WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.939
- We've had some incredible
times over the past five years,

00:00:03.939 --> 00:00:04.772
Ooh!
- Ooh!

00:00:04.772 --> 00:00:06.910
- Visited 14 countries.
- My God.

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:08.335
- Daddy, Daddy.
- No.

00:00:08.335 --> 00:00:11.196
- [Jack] And we've loved every minute.

00:00:11.196 --> 00:00:13.850
- Very much I enjoyed your company.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:14.830
- Hug?

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.320
- No, I don't think so.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.880
(dramatic music)
- Now finally.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.403
Oh!
- Oh, my God!

00:00:21.544 --> 00:00:23.110
- Daddy! (retching)

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:25.367
We're off on a magical mystery UK tour.

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:27.898
- [Michael] You need to
whack him with the oar.

00:00:27.898 --> 00:00:28.731
- Michael!

00:00:28.731 --> 00:00:30.590
Perhaps the greatest challenge of all.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.960
It's delicious.
(beep)

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.152
Why, it's yummy.
- Sit up straight.

00:00:33.152 --> 00:00:34.683
- It's very nice, sorry.

00:00:34.683 --> 00:00:36.953
- So let's get this show on the road.

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:38.007
- Daddy!

00:00:38.007 --> 00:00:39.574
(Jack thudding to ground)
Uh!

00:00:39.574 --> 00:00:41.814
(discordant bagpipe music)
- Jack, just go.

00:00:41.814 --> 00:00:43.412
(discordant bagpipe music)
- Oh!

00:00:43.412 --> 00:00:44.812
- [Jack] I'm losing, my, oh!

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:48.954
- Completely mad, that boy is.

00:00:48.954 --> 00:00:51.619
(melodic rock music)

00:00:51.619 --> 00:00:54.210
(beep) was that?

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:55.660
- Sap, sap!

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.643
Shut that sphincter!

00:00:57.643 --> 00:00:59.931
- Oh, what a good-looking man I am.

00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:01.937
- (gasps) Look, Stonehenge.

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:03.553
- No, I am not-
- No, I want to see it.

00:01:03.553 --> 00:01:06.626
- Shut that sunroof.
- I want to see Stonehenge.

00:01:06.626 --> 00:01:07.843
- Come down.
- Oh!

00:01:07.843 --> 00:01:10.380
Just 'cause you were there,
when they were erected.

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:11.454
- Very funny.

00:01:11.454 --> 00:01:13.291
(soft melodic music)

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:15.567
- [Jack] Sad that it's coming to an end.

00:01:15.567 --> 00:01:17.860
- [Michael] Yeah, I know I'm bloody lucky.

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.340
- [Jack] I'm bloody lucky as well.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.382
- And we've had a great time

00:01:21.382 --> 00:01:24.020
and I'm sure we'll do lots
of other things together,

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.860
just no more travels.

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.906
(melodic orchestral music)

00:01:27.906 --> 00:01:29.750
- Do you feel nostalgic?

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:30.832
- No, I don't.

00:01:30.832 --> 00:01:34.415
(melodic orchestral music)

